 - 2026-06-07: MOAT SCISSOR replication on an INDEPENDENT corpus (defeats the in-distribution-tuning critique): re-run the exp3916 scissor (strong boosted self-verify arm via the exp3915 robust harness + bootstrap CI residual-catch + error-overlap Jaccard) on a SECOND held-out corpus — a ProcessBench math slice (HuggingFace Qwen/ProcessBench), FALLBACK the local held-out data/fover_test_v4.json — that neither the energy ensemble nor the FoVer-tuned probe was trained on. Confirm MOAT_SURVIVES (residual_catch_ci95.low>0.5 AND overlap<0.6 AND n_res>=30) replicates off the original corpus. Disk-reads exp3915 (no hard gate). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_all_gguf_inference_failed; results/experiment_3928_moat_scissor_replication.json
 - 2026-06-07: ARC-AGI-3 first realistic agentic run — verifier-as-router ACTION-EFFICIENCY WITH vs WITHOUT the pruner (north-star §5, sequenced after the offline proof; GPU-free): extend the exp3919 scaffold to a richer non-toy synthetic ARC-AGI-3-style env (multi-step, larger action space, known goal); measure actions-to-solve WITH the verifier-as-action-pruner (energy-scored action selection) vs a no-verifier baseline (random/greedy), reporting the action-efficiency ratio (the Exp1165 ~4x shape, now with a real baseline). ALSO a real ARC-AGI-3 benchmark access preflight (arXiv:2603.24621). HONEST: synthetic env, NO real-benchmark performance claim. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: arc_agi3_verifier_router_HELPS_ratio1.959_ci1.742-2.194_synthetic_first_agentic_step_real_benchmark_reachabletrue; results/experiment_3929_arc_agi3_action_efficiency.json
 - 2026-06-08: FR-11 continuous self-learning v26 (research-program.md MANDATE) — load the persisted v25 independence-reweighting state (exp3921), continue Tier-1 ONLINE reweighting on a FRESH verification-corpus slice (arXiv:2604.07650), AND additionally learn the exp3927 cascade escalation band ONLINE (Tier-1 self-learning tied to the deployable cascade artifact). Confirm the learned weighting STILL holds the +0.0185 memory-ablation contribution + frozen 0.9131 across the v25->v26 iteration. CPU counter updates (<1us/update, the Tier-1 hardware path). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: fr11_v26_INVARIANT_HELD_auroc0.908_memcontrib0.0185_cascade_band_learnedtrue_state_persisted; results/experiment_3930_fr11_v26_cascade_band_online_learning.json
